{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15112480","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15112480","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1511248001:0":{"text":"The Widowmaker is truly a huge creature...","source_cn":"巨蛛王……还真是庞然大物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDBE9F5C22F1C235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511248002:0":{"text":"Umm... Tilaya, are you sure you can beat this thing?","source_cn":"那、那个……缇洛亚，你真的打得过它吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7244F4757C2F894E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511248003:0":{"text":"No, wait. Can anyone beat this thing?","source_cn":"不对。有人打得过它吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE411EA07175EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511248004:0":{"text":"Nazrik defeated it once.","source_cn":"那非曾经战胜过它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFA8B6DCDA493514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511248005:0":{"text":"When he left the Wildborn tribe, he went this way.","source_cn":"几年前他脱离雅库伯尔时，就是从这个方向离开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF78000B24A9A979","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511248006:0":{"text":"But Nazrik was blessed by the goddess. Tilaya is just—Ow!","source_cn":"但那非是曾经得到过神明恩赐的勇士，缇洛亚就只是——哎哟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E17CDD8AF314F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511248007:0":{"text":"Hey, enough with the doom and gloom! I've run through how to take down the Widowmaker a hundred times in my head. I got this.","source_cn":"喂，别还没开打就败人志气！我已经在心里演练过无数次该如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6628969B771F300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511248008:1":{"text":"Pour this tree oil on the eastern clearing, and wait for my signal before setting it alight.","source_cn":"拿好这瓶树油，浇到东边的空地上，等我发出信号就用火点燃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5250720398F9C8CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:12::2":{"text":"Tree oil","source_cn":"树油","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C3BFE7569AC136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511248009:0":{"text":"Who? Me?!","source_cn":"谁？我、我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x753ECC1A0B1B2B46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511248010:1":{"text":"Did you think you could just talk your way to the Dark Forest?","source_cn":"笨蛋！你以为跋涉去理想乡只要动动嘴皮就可以？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6D9441925EB1E83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511248011:1":{"text":"Suck it up! You've got more things you need to do in the future!","source_cn":"鼓起勇气，你以后要干的事还多着呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F8BB539EF88B29A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511248012:1":{"text":"Step two, listen up! Use every trick you've learned up until now. When the Widowmaker is drawn by the fire, I want a massive spike trap rigged in its lair. Make it snap the second it steps foot in there.","source_cn":"第二步，其他人听好——拿出你们在雅库伯尔学到的本领，趁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F7A153C5773D8C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511248013:1":{"text":"I'll go wipe out the spider eggs in the nest first. Then... it's the final showdown.","source_cn":"我会先扫灭巢穴里的蜘蛛卵。然后……就是决战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25742C91F47B3829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1511248013":{"text":"I'll go wipe out the spider eggs in the nest first. Then... it's the final showdown.","source_cn":"我会先扫灭巢穴里的蜘蛛卵。然后……就是决战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25742C91F47B3829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1511248014:1":{"text":"Yes, thanks for the concern though.","source_cn":"多谢，好意我心领了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25D193060C259D75","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yes, thanks for the concern though.","female":"Yes, thanks for the concern though.","variant_male_record_index":"190054","variant_female_record_index":"190055","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511248016:1":{"text":"Leave the rest to me.","source_cn":"其余的，就尽管交给我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9335ABB5B914C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:22:1511248017:1":{"text":"Tilaya's unshakable confidence silences any further debate.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DC571434E16DCFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:23:1511248018:1":{"text":"Soon, everything is ready...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6D9EA9097D1D908","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"You're going alone?","source_cn":"你一个人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDE7BF32A79D80524","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You're going alone?","female":"You're going alone?","variant_male_record_index":"79513","variant_female_record_index":"79514","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511248015:1":{"text":"That's high praise coming from you. I guess I'm doing a good job.","source_cn":"嘿，能得到英雄夸奖，看来我干得确实不错。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8CF50D097EA31E8D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's high praise coming from you. I guess I'm doing a good job.","female":"That's high praise coming from you. I guess I'm doing a good job.","variant_male_record_index":"190057","variant_female_record_index":"190058","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:1:2":{"text":"It seems you're well-prepared.","source_cn":"看来你确实早有准备","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x13DF2E167726F5EF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It seems you're well-prepared.","female":"It seems you're well-prepared.","variant_male_record_index":"79515","variant_female_record_index":"79516","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:缇洛亚":{"text":"Tilaya","source":"缇洛亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:尤桑迪":{"text":"Yohan","source":"尤桑迪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":23,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":4}}